Message-Id: <20260909-submit-sunxi-nand-vendor-oob-layout-v1-v3-5-838cb0ba1547@gmail.com>
References: <20260909-submit-sunxi-nand-vendor-oob-layout-v1-v3-0-838cb0ba1547@gmail.com>
